# A currency, not loot: it sells for nothing, and the shop prices things in it
# by the mark below. The triangle marks its stage of the game and the colour
# marks the piece it buys.
name: "Cygnus Shoulder Token"
kind: ITEM_KIND_TOKEN
description:
  "A feather from the Empress's own wing. The shop trades one for any "
  "Cygnus shoulder."
currency_mark: "▲"
currency_color: CURRENCY_COLOR_PURPLE
